responded: Now I understand the issue better. The problem is in the `print_sep_string` function. The loop structure is incorrect:

```c
for (; separators_not_printed > 0; --separators_not_printed)
{
    while (l-- > 0)
    {
        if (*s == ' ')
        {
            s++;
            ++spaces_not_printed;
        }
        else
        {
            if (spaces_not_printed > 0)
                print_white_space ();
            putchar (*s++);
            ++output_position;
        }
    }
